.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH stats 1  "stats " 
.SH NAME
stats \- Show run statistics from history.db
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstats\fR [\fB\-\-limit\fR] [\fB\-\-explain\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show run statistics from history.db
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-limit\fR \fI<LIMIT>\fR [default: 10]
Maximum number of snippets in the ranking
.TP
\fB\-\-explain\fR
Explain the saved\-time formula
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg stats
